# Ellowring student collage UI (do not re-ask)

When editing student dashboard UI, **match the Ellowring Software Solutions collage screenshots**, not admin tables or plain CRUD.

## Always

- Use `@/components/student-home/collage-ui` (`CollagePage`, `BlueHero`, `WhiteCard`, `ScoreRing`, `ProgressBar`, `PillButton`, `FilterChips`, `AiAssistantChip`).
- Colors: primary `#0F3DDE`, navy `#0B1F3A`, canvas `#FAFBFC`, white cards `rounded-[20-24px]`, soft shadows.
- **One font family only:** Plus Jakarta Sans for headings and body (`font-display` / body use the same face). Hierarchy = size + weight (400/500/600/700/800), never mix Inter/serif/other faces on student screens.
- Mobile-first card sections; `lg:` two-column grids where the mock shows them.
- Bottom nav (all tracks): **Home · Learn · Explore · Opportunities · Profile** via `StudentBottomNav`.
- Prefer dense screenshot layouts with mock+live hybrid data over empty / RoleApiTablePage.

