## Never

- Do not replace these pages with `RoleApiTablePage` or bare admin-style tables.
- Do not invent a purple/cream theme; keep Ellowring blue collage language.
- Do not drop bottom nav from `StudentShell`.

If the user attaches the same collage images again, **treat it as a fidelity audit** — tighten layout to match; do not say the work is already done without comparing sections.
